<h2 id="atlassian">Atlassian apps</h2>
<p>Apps for Atlassian site administrators and the compliance teams who audit them. Each one follows the same rules: preview before anything changes, a record of who changed what and why, a way back where the product allows one, and delegation only within limits an administrator has approved.</p>
